## The phone's tour

tour-tabs-title = Four groups
tour-tabs-text = Looks, Tune, Crop and Tools. Tap one, or swipe along this bar. Open another photo at the top left; Export is at the top right.
tour-choose-title = Choose what to change
tour-choose-text = Swipe up or down on the photo, or on the ruler: up for the next value, down for the one before. Light, Colour and Detail are tabs over the list: keep your finger down and move it left or right to switch.
tour-adjust-title = Change it
tour-adjust-text = Swipe left or right on the photo. Slowly for fine steps, quickly for big ones.
tour-reset-title = Put it back
tour-reset-text = Double-tap the photo to put that value back where it started.
tour-hold-title = Compare
tour-hold-text = Press and hold the photo to see the original. Let go to see your edit.
tour-strip-title = Jump ahead
tour-strip-text = Tap Light, Colour or Detail to jump there, or swipe this bar for the next one. Each dot is a value; amber ones are changed.
tour-needs-photo = Open a photo first: this step is done on it.
tour-end-title = That's it
tour-end-text = Pinch to zoom; fine adjust in the ⋯ menu makes every change ten times finer. The tour is in that menu too, whenever you want it again.
tour-skipped = Tour skipped
tour-again = The tour will show on the next launch
tour-skip = skip
tour-next = Next
tour-done = Done

